  <name>Padwight</name>
  <summary>Gamepad remapper with per-game profiles</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Padwight grabs your gamepads and turns them into keyboard, mouse and gamepad input, with
      per-game profiles, layers, macros, on-screen menus and an on-screen keyboard.
    </p>
    <p>
      A background daemon runs the active profile. The settings window edits profiles and
      games, and can import and export packs of games.
    </p>
  </description>
